confident smirk while the girl’s face is shocked and confused. Here’s a better reference for them.\nhttps://skeb.jp/@if959u/works/476\nThe girl with the red and black hair will be sitting on the floor in front of the girl in blue with an irritated and focused look while the boy in black will be sitting to her right  in front of the boy in blue leaning forward and focusing on the game. \nThe brunette with the ponytail is sitting beside the boy in blue with a competitive smile. \nLastly the boy in green is sitting next to the girl in blue with a calm grin just enjoying the game.\nThey are all in their early 20s. Thanks!!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kajaniya2/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2527179, "client_id": 812517, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68458dc2/uploads/origins/514a08f2-552d-4a2f-ab9f-5a2472a3cb56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1685267ee3902a5d0e619bc7214be10", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68458dc2/uploads/origins/514a08f2-552d-4a2f-ab9f-5a2472a3cb56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1685267ee3902a5d0e619bc7214be10, https://si.imgix.net/68458dc2/uploads/origins/514a08f2-552d-4a2f-ab9f-5a2472a3cb56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7ad216c817fd0b99668acc38ee3425a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68458dc2/uploads/origins/514a08f2-552d-4a2f-ab9f-5a2472a3cb56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2358bac8fd43228b3c22d00cbec60e88 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68458dc2/uploads/origins/514a08f2-552d-4a2f-ab9f-5a2472a3cb56?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45264bce650ad4